      * 11/29/24 C:300 Support: 118040 (UBIC)                         *
      *                File created to find policies having Incorrect *
      *                Cancellation Date                              *
      *                                                               *
      *****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PQX01                     TEXT('QRYCXP OUTFILE')
     A            QXCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            QXFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            QXEMP#    R               REFFLD(EMP#)
     A            QXDIV     R               REFFLD(DIV)
     A            QXFYR     R               REFFLD(FYR)
     A            QXCXDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Policy' 'Cancellation' -
     A                                      'Date')
     A            QXEFDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Policy' 'Effective' -
     A                                      'Date')
     A            QXEXDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Policy' 'Expiration' -
     A                                      'Date')
     A            QXPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            QXEMCAD1  R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Policy' 'Summary' -
     A                                      'Cancel Date')
